{"server":"cn","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_05_end","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_07","title":"龟裂","storyCode":"DM-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"1efd2b746c63ce8939d3ce9c055132f122503f74ba7ffffbbb376ebf2d291445","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"塔露拉变了。\n第一次见到塔露拉的时候，她给我的感觉，和特蕾西娅殿下很像。\n但殿下一直非常的悲伤，她背负着......也知晓着这片大地的更多秘密。\n塔露拉不同，她很愤怒，足够冷静的，却又充满热情的愤怒。\n虽然细小很多，却同样强盛。也许他们这样的人无论力量大小，都拥有着近似的部分。\n这股愤怒催生了整合运动，让无数追随者趋之若鹜。\n但很快......就改变了。\n我们每天的工作，变成了煽动、加害和挑拨。\n这不再是一场感染者的革命——\n——而是我们在卡兹戴尔目睹过无数次的，被过度操纵的战争阴谋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"她没有追上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我们真的和她正面碰上，事情就麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该对塔露拉使用法术，这也不是第一次了，我们要时常小心自己看见的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔露拉的身上一定发生了什么，这件事必须告诉W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了W几次的小动作，我们已经遭到那些暴徒的猜忌了，这还不够吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底看到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的塔露拉只是个反抗者。她把反抗的机会带给那些被解放的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"现在呢？他们几乎毫不收敛自己的欲望，单纯的破坏，滥杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"这不足以说明什么，萨卡兹之外的种族对感染者素来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在说这种行为本身怎么了，我是在说这样的行为会招致什么后果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉她......在葬送整合运动，刻意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你不觉得这个情况似曾相识吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"她是个优秀的领袖，能将这些普通的感染者卷入战争，甚至带给他们胜利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但她，也只有她才能用最神不知鬼不觉的方法，一步步毁掉自己一手搭建起来的高塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至塔露拉她自己，都只是其中一块比较精美的砖瓦，随时可以被粉碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"和三年前给我的感觉一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但他......他或许素来如此，他可以毫不犹豫地做到这一切......只是藏的很好罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉不同，她的变化太突然了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"她的影子......她甚至有两个影子，不像是法术的痕迹，倒像是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"一座废墟，古老，强盛，满是那种力量的残留......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你的法术性质很特殊，尽管如此，你这次的感觉也太模糊了，这还是不构成行动的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但这件事W必须知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"小声点，我们已经被注意到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"任何动作都会成为别人的把柄，你明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那你觉得我们还能经受住第二次巴别塔那样的变故吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少W不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找她，既然加尔森已经死了，她就是新的领导人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！如果塔露拉真的已经注意到了，你这样会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"等不了，别想命令我，现在我们还是平起平坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"话是这么说，这好像是我第一次抗命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该总是想这么多的，赫德雷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（W，就在前面，穿过这条巷子就......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（那里不是营地？她在做什么？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（总之得快一点——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......？有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的语气，魔族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"先是有几支佣兵队伍叛逃，接着又让敌人出现在了城内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你们犯下的错误太多，你该不会以为领袖没有看在眼里吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"让开，我没有义务听你抱怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你有这个义务对塔露拉负责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——我明白了，等我向W汇报完之后，我会去向塔露拉报到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要的不是这种“负责”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"啧.....来真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才发生的袭击波及了这里，萨卡兹雇佣兵小队长之一的伊内丝，死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚毅的整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"不去确认她的尸体？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚才的战斗动静太大，已经有人被吸引过来了，立刻炸毁这条街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚毅的整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动也要有人......和她一并奋战到了最后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚毅的整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚毅的整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"照顾好我的家人，他们还在城里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我向你许诺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......把他的尸体弄得再像回事一些......好，就这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动士兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"W很快就会察觉到的......我们走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"没让赫德雷跟来......果然，是正确的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，切尔诺伯格街道上的景观树......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......是桦树......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多的风景，和那里......都是，交叉的影子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动士兵"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["坚毅的整合运动术师"]}]}
